---
source: crates/rattler-bin/src/main.rs
expression: redact(subcommand.render_long_help().to_string())
---
Add one or more conda package archives to a prefix without solving

Usage: rattler inject-into-prefix [OPTIONS] <PACKAGES>...

Arguments:
  <PACKAGES>...
          Local paths to conda package archives (.conda or .tar.bz2)

Options:
  -p, --prefix <TARGET_PREFIX>
          Target prefix to inject the package into
          
          [default: .prefix]

      --skip-compatibility-checks
          Skip platform and dependency compatibility checks

  -v, --verbose
          Log verbose

      --offline
          Disable network access and use only locally cached data

  -h, --help
          Print help
